WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:11.025
Healthy body, healthy mind!

2
00:00:11.026 --> 00:00:13.882
Do you exercise every day?

3
00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:19.069
No? Not even once a week?

4
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.304
Hana: What are you doing, Mom?

5
00:00:21.305 --> 00:00:23.101
Mom: I am exercising.

6
00:00:23.102 --> 00:00:25.622
Do you want to exercise with me?

7
00:00:25.623 --> 00:00:29.708
Hana: Sure, I'd love to.

8
00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:31.946
Mom: Let me turn on the music.

9
00:00:31.947 --> 00:00:34.178
Let's do some stretching.

10
00:00:34.179 --> 00:00:35.315
Mom: Here we go.

11
00:00:35.316 --> 00:00:39.499
One, two, three.

12
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.432
Mom: Stretch your arms out.

13
00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:45.597
Left, right, left, right.

14
00:00:45.598 --> 00:00:49.302
Hana: Left, right, left, right.

15
00:00:49.303 --> 00:00:51.737
Mom: Now bend your knees.

16
00:00:51.738 --> 00:00:56.531
Hana: One, two, one, two.

17
00:00:56.532 --> 00:00:59.233
Mom: Stretch your leg out like this.

18
00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:03.696
Hana: Like this? Oh, that hurts!

19
00:01:03.697 --> 00:01:07.496
Mom: Stand up. Turn your head around.

20
00:01:07.497 --> 00:01:11.709
Hana: One, two, three.

21
00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:18.122
Mom: Now breathe in and out slowly.

22
00:01:18.123 --> 00:01:21.516
Good job, Hana.

23
00:01:21.517 --> 00:01:23.386
Hana: That was fun, Mom.

24
00:01:23.387 --> 00:01:25.878
Let's work out every morning!

25
00:01:25.879 --> 00:01:29.288
Mom: Sounds good to me!

26
00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:33.491
Yes, I began to exercise every morning.

27
00:01:33.492 --> 00:01:38.248
Look, I'm starting to get muscles now!
